      "start_line": 10,
      "text": "  rule <k> #sameChars(S0:IntSeq, S1:IntSeq)\n        => Call(\n             closureVal(\n               (\"s0\", \"s1\", .ParamNames),\n               (Return(\n                  Compare(\n                    Call(Name(\"set\"), (Name(\"s0\"), .Exprs)),\n                    CmpOp(\"==\",\n                      Call(Name(\"set\"), (Name(\"s1\"), .Exprs)))))\n                .Stmts),\n               0),\n             (str(S0), str(S1), .Exprs))\n           ...\n       </k>"
    }
